@0    = ~Uhm, do I know you? Anyways, I have no time for small talk, friend. I'm just taking some supplies before I leave the village.~
@1    = ~Why are you in such a hurry?~
@2    = ~What's that strange bag you're holding? Where did you get it from?~
@3    = ~Goodbye, then.~
@4    = ~My friend is waiting for me. And--I'm just fed up with this palce, y'know? I'd rather be in Athkatla, Trademeet... even Beregost - it's been a while since I visited my sis - but not Imnesvale. Too many mosquitoes and... other stuff.~
@5    = ~What's that strange bag you're holding?~
@6    = ~Goodbye.~
@7    = ~What, this one? I found it along with... some other stuff. I'm planning to sell it. It smells strange and... it's just weird. There is some kind of black powder inside - perhaps it's valuable to someone.~
@8    = ~I talked to a certain ghost. You stole it from their place. You don't even know what you did, do you?~
@9    = ~I think it's what I've been looking for. I can offer you five hundred gold for it.~
@10   = ~I see. Well, good luck with that. I guess I should be going.~
@11   = ~You shouldn't have taken that bag. Your life ends here.~
@12   = ~What...?! I mean--uhm... Okay, I took it, so what? Everyone's got to live somehow, right? You're an adventurer, too, aren't you? So you should know what I mean.~
@13   = ~I want to buy that bag from you. Here, I'll offer you five hundred gold pieces for it.~
@14   = ~You know what? I think I'll just kill you.~
@15   = ~I'll return later. Don't you dare to leave until I'm back.~
@16   = ~Look, I'm the hero of Baldur's Gate - the one who stopped the war. I think you should just give that bag to me. If you do that, we're all good.~
@17   = ~Five hun--really?! Sure! Take the bag and... whatever that's inside. Gods, that's to you I'll be able to buy all the supplies and visit Beregost again! Thanks and good luck with... whatever you do!~
@18   = ~What?! You--you won't get me!~
@19   = ~You're THE HERO everyone talks about?! U-uh, listen, I don't want to get on your bad side. Just take it and forget you ever saw me, alright?~
@20   = ~Bye, I guess.~
